<p>A gentle wind circles around the caster, increasing carrying capacity by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">64, 87, 104, 119, 132,</acronym> defense against projectiles by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">16, 22, 27, 30, 34,</acronym> pin immunity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 36%, 57%, 74%, 90%</acronym> and stun immunity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 18%, 28%, 37%, 45%.</acronym></p><p>At level 4 it also makes you levitate slightly above the ground, allowing you to ignore some traps.</p><p>At level 5 it also grants <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 10%, 15%, 20%, 25%</acronym> movement speed and removes <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 5, 7, 10, 12</acronym> fatigue.</p>